Description: avcodec/h2645_sei: export all defined frame packing layouts
 .
 Export H.264 tiled packing and preserve quincunx sampling of columns,
 rows and top/bottom layouts in Stereo 3D frame side data. Accept the
 required content interpretation 0 for H.264 two-dimensional packing.
 .
 Exercise 50 codec, layout, quincunx and eye-order combinations through
 the decoder export path. The previous implementation fails the new
 layout cases; the updated decoder passes all entries. Temporal frame
 identity remains independent of eye order.
 .
 Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Origin: other, https://code.ffmpeg.org/danielcamposramos/FFmpeg/commit/ec415d4abf62bf1e0bf3094b39cd9f60157d009a
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-11-09

